{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/keyfeatures.png?t=1744902209\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>up to 6-player co-op extraction game  </strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>procedurally generated levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>unique enemies</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>twitch integration</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Loot contaminated items, manage your energy and stamina, and face unique enemies as you unlock new sectors and upgrades.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/preparelobby.png?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/preperelobbyelevator.gif?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Type <strong>READY</strong> on the console. Take the elevator and dive in. Find and <strong>close the vents</strong>. Extract. Upgrade. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/closeventsloot.png?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/lootstuff_vent.gif?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First <strong>find and close the vents</strong>, than loot contaminated stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/survive.png?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/loot_unicorn_maniac.gif?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch out for traps and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/backin_gameover.png?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/gameover.gif?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You failed. Loot lost. Credit value: 0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Return to the lobby. Prepare better. Try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/twiitch.png?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/twitch.gif?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play with Twitch</strong>. Will chat boost your energy - or drain every last drop? Let the viewers vote good or bad just like your mates ...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/goodone.png?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/dancedisco.gif?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn on the radio. Hit party mode. Celebrate survival - with your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/bad_teammate.png?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/purplelight_mate.gif?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The purple light helps against enemies.\u00a0You can also use it to annoy your teammates - if you're that kind of teammate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Just know it drains your battery. Fast.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2824020?t=1744902209","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744902209","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/7bde06e092d0ccb22d909d6b4786d951f8f6c7cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744902209","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/7bde06e092d0ccb22d909d6b4786d951f8f6c7cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744902209","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3669140,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/keyfeatures.png?t=1744902209\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>up to 6-player co-op extraction game  </strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>procedurally generated levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>unique enemies</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>twitch integration</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Loot contaminated items, manage your energy and stamina, and face unique enemies as you unlock new sectors and upgrades.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/preparelobby.png?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/preperelobbyelevator.gif?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Type <strong>READY</strong> on the console. Take the elevator and dive in. Find and <strong>close the vents</strong>. Extract. Upgrade. Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/closeventsloot.png?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/lootstuff_vent.gif?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First <strong>find and close the vents</strong>, than loot contaminated stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/survive.png?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/loot_unicorn_maniac.gif?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch out for traps and enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/backin_gameover.png?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/gameover.gif?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You failed. Loot lost. Credit value: 0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Return to the lobby. Prepare better. Try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/twiitch.png?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/twitch.gif?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play with Twitch</strong>. Will chat boost your energy - or drain every last drop? Let the viewers vote good or bad just like your mates ...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/goodone.png?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/dancedisco.gif?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn on the radio. Hit party mode. Celebrate survival - with your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/bad_teammate.png?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/extras/purplelight_mate.gif?t=1744902209\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The purple light helps against enemies.\u00a0You can also use it to annoy your teammates - if you're that kind of teammate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Just know it drains your battery. Fast.</i></p>","developers":["aerraflow"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2824020/39217ded3a69f23a9048e501bbab5aeb88eeb39d/header.jpg?t